Like I mentioned, there is no information of the allowed starting
role/race combinations in the save files. The change is only in a bitmap
field that is used when a new character is created, and it doesn't change
the length of any structure. It just changes three bits from value 0 to
value 1, allowing the creation of orcish, gnomish and dwarven priest
characters. 
So this change is fully save file compatible to both directions.

BTW, I believe orcish and gnomish priest characters are possible even
without this change, if the human/elven priest character gets polymorphed
to an orc or gnome. They were just not possible to start the game with.

